[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369502850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692#issuecomment-5369502850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692","id":5369502850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQAwcgg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T11:56:10Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T12:06:31Z","body":"> We've been revising the implementation with Claude AI, and it's possible it found and Fixed the root cause of:\r\n\r\nDid you mean to link something here? Is this PR description human authored? In what ways has AI been used in this PR?\r\n\r\nThis description is far too verbose and includes irrelevant details","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369502850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369664955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692#issuecomment-5369664955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692","id":5369664955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQA6Vuw","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T12:14:01Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T12:14:01Z","body":"Nothing to link, the fix is that exact one liner..\r\n\r\nI used Claude to analyze the source code, and track down the origin of the SPIR-V Warning..\r\n\r\nAfter some investigation Claude proposed this change; \r\nwe had to go back and forth as the syntax was complex, but on the third try > it worked.\r\n\r\n-Of course I applied this changes to my own codebase, \r\ntested it, and double-checked everything was working correctly.\r\n\r\nMy own iOS app has been published on Apple Store for at least three months with this fix,\r\nand everything seems to work Normally and perfectly, No Crashes or strange behavior.\r\n\r\nHowever my app is a 2D Audio app, with only two small custom Shaders > No 3D at all.\r\n\r\n-So the best in any case, would be to have you guys Revise this fix, \r\nand make sure everything is correct and works perfectly in all possible scenarios..\r\n\r\nI did this to try and improve my own app;\r\neven tho it's not a definitive fix (that will be impossible..),\r\nat least it seems to ease the Shader Baking compilation step, and potentially first-launch matters, \r\nso I thought it could be important, and a good idea to share it!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369664955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369685159","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692#issuecomment-5369685159","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692","id":5369685159,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQA7kpw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T12:16:03Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T12:18:35Z","body":"While this is a trivial and tiny fix we do not accept AI authored changes, or changes that the author did not figure out or understand by themselves, this one is probably okay but please be aware of this, this means human written comments, issue reports, and PR descriptions\r\n\r\nSo please remove unnecessary details from the PR description","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369685159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369872376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692#issuecomment-5369872376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692","id":5369872376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQBG_-A","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T12:35:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T17:56:24Z","body":"Right, I understand your stance on AI assisted PR's.\r\n\r\nIn this case, it was just a matter of Syntax, so I though it could be acceptable.. \r\nthere's only so many ways one command can be written correctly, right?\r\n\r\n-This simple fix seems to unlock an interesting aspect in the whole Metal implementation;\r\nAnd in fact, I kinda thought the step was broken on purpose, \r\nas if you guys Locked it down while the whole thing was being sorted out; on Apple's side too..\r\n\r\nFor that reason I didn't have much expectations, \r\nand thought fixing this step would mostly > highlight the next broken step in the chain, etc..\r\n\r\nBut to my surprise the resulting compilation seemed to be correct,\r\nthe files/content seem to correspond to what would be expected on a working baked export;\r\nand when running on my iPhone everything works normally, and at least as good/fast as always..\r\n\r\nThe performance gain is minimal on my 2D Audio App,\r\nbut there's a chance other apps that use shaders more heavily could benefit more directly... right?\r\n\r\n-No problem in shortening the PR!!\r\nWhere/what do you want me to cut?\r\n \r\nHowever this is my own written explanation of the situation, process and findings, no AI..\r\n\r\nShall I cut it after .. \"-The Cache files seem to be included inside the PCK\"..\r\nOr where exactly?\r\n\r\nAfter that I'm mostly showing the little verification we did..\r\nI would not have even tried myself without making sure the export looked good!\r\n\r\nShall I cut the Scope & Limitations section too?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369872376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5369889693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692#issuecomment-5369889693","issue_